--unwind 4 --rounds 2 --no-por --allow-pointer-unsoundness --symmetric-instance 2
^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
no family could be instantiated
--
symmetric arrays: instantiating
--
An index started at a nondeterministic offset does not reach every slot alike:
i runs over offset .. offset + 1 with offset bounded by the original size, so
after a reduction to two slots it reads past the end of the array, and what it
reads there is a value no slot held. This made pthread-ext/09_fmaxsym-zero and
11_fmaxsymopt-zero report a race they do not have. The family is refused.
